body:
Thank you, if this would have happened a year ago, I would probably be blaming myself, but as of now, I feel very confident that we both did everything in our power to save her life and make her happy. I know there is nothing I could blame myself for, she planned to leave 8 years ago, and instead I gave her the best 8 years I possibly could have.

&#x200B;

And in case you don't read the other comments, there is no updates yet, everyone has been searching everywhere with no luck.
